<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves up FIM 1.89 bln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves up FIM 1.89 bln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to April 8 showed the following data in millions of markka compared to March 27  SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 61,587	59,700</p>
<p> Money market intervention    13,293	18,158</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,902	 1,907</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,254	 2,256</p>
<p> Other				 7,029	 6,923</p>
<p> Total assets		     86,065	88,944</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>In the previous week, to March 27, reserves fell by 1.17 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
